From 6aeeb0e1157a869abccd279a215809ce8388fab5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agnya <manthram@Pradass-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:32:34 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add 15 general Sri Lanka travel FAQs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New "Sri Lanka Travel Basics" category covering the common questions
travelers ask before any trip, separate from the existing platform-
feature FAQs (signup, posting, chat, etc.): visa/ETA, best time to
visit, currency & cards, safety (incl. solo/female travelers),
getting around, SIM/eSIM, tipping, temple dress code, tap water,
vaccinations, daily budget, language, trip length, and plug type —
plus a closing question that bridges back to the product itself.

Researched against current sources rather than written from memory,
since ETA fees, SIM data allowances, and daily budgets are exactly
the kind of numbers that go stale. Worth revisiting every few months.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 client/src/pages/help/faq.tsx | 153 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 143 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

